{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Hallelujah. Praise, servants of YHWH.</b> The reason for saying הללו three times, is like the manner of 'the hall of YHWH' one time after another." "And the meaning of 'servants of YHWH' — you are servants of YHWH, like 'one statute for the congregation and for you' (Numbers 15:15). And say thus: may it be — and this is the true praise."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 113, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:34.558214930Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}